#import "/_lib/0.1.1.typ": *
#show: template

#taxon[Definition]
#title[Species of non-degenerate cartesian decompositions]
We define a _non-degenerate cartesian decomposition_ of a finite set $S$ to be a term of the type
$
  "cart-dec" (S) :-= sum_(A,B : "FinSet")(A xx_"FinSet" B  ~= S) xx "is-surj"(pi_1) xx "is-surj"(pi_2).
$
Where $xx_"FinSet"$ is the #local("00DZ")[cartesian product in FinSet].
$pi_1 : A xx B -> A$ and $pi_2 : A xx B -> B$ are the projections onto the first and second factor respectively.
